From 1bc565dcda32e75de6344f754bcfbfbf62726ccd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 18:36:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix: restore configurator i18n wiring lost in the "revert
 to previous working version" commit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

f569796 swapped in an older version of craft-your-experience/page.tsx
that predated the next-intl integration, silently removing all t()
calls and the useTranslations import. Re-applied translations using
the same configurator.* message keys already in en.json/it.json
(steps, selection warnings, guests, dates, budget, contact, intro,
nav, loading, poweredBy) — no new keys needed, no other logic touched.

Also removes translationsfix.patch, a stray file accidentally
committed to the repo instead of being applied as a patch.
