-Subject: [PATCH] fix: repair configurator i18n, exclude admin from
- translation, wire Lara CMS translations to frontend
-
-- Restore the configurator EN/IT message keys wiped by a recent rollback
-  on main (both locales had gone empty, breaking /craft-your-experience
-  in every language, not just Italian).
-- Root layout now skips the locale cookie sync and language switcher for
-  /admin and forces English there, via a pathname header set in
-  middleware.ts. Admin is an internal tool and should never be localized.
-- getFullExperiences() now accepts an optional locale and, for non-English
-  locales, overlays the Lara-translated title/short_description/description
-  from experience_content_translations (via getLocalizedField, previously
-  unused dead code). The public proposal page passes the visitor's locale
-  so Italian visitors actually see the translated CMS copy instead of
-  always falling back to English.
